Subject: [PATCH] Constructible: the empty-input decider is
 computesFunInTime_decideEq []; public-facing module text in Constructible and
 Savitch

spaceConstructible_poly's decider for the empty input now cites the published
Turing.FinTM.computesFunInTime_decideEq [] (Build/WordTests, now imported) in place of its
inline conversion of computesFunInTime_ifEq [] [true] [false]. The two module docstrings drop
their history and audit labels, and Savitch's gains its Main definitions heading; four
declaration docstrings drop audit and phase labels. No statement changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
